{
  "_comment": [
    "Localization map for PomoGem. Read by Scripts/l10n/l10n.py and by PomoGemTests (LocalizationCatalogTests, LocalizationEnvironmentTests).",
    "rules: ordered globs over the shipping Swift sources; the first match decides the table (the catalog) and the package that owns the file. A string's table is chosen by the file it is written in, never by the screen that shows it.",
    "catalogs: one String Catalog per table. There is deliberately no Localizable.xcstrings: an untabled literal must stay detectable.",
    "shipping_languages: the localizations every bundle must contain. English is added here only by the localization integration change that also adds the English InfoPlist values (see Docs/Localization.md)."
  ],
  "source_language": "ja",
  "shipping_languages": [
    "ja"
  ],
  "source_roots": [
    "PomoGem",
    "PomoGemWidgets",
    "PomoGemScreenTimeMonitor",
    "Shared"
  ],
  "product_targets": [
    "PomoGem",
    "PomoGemWidgets",
    "PomoGemScreenTimeMonitor"
  ],
  "rules": [
    {
      "glob": "PomoGem/Debug/**",
      "table": null,
      "package": "none",
      "note": "DEBUG-only fixtures; never localized"
    },
    {
      "glob": "PomoGem/App/Theme.swift",
      "table": "Common",
      "package": "l10n-00-infra"
    },
    {
      "glob": "PomoGem/Core/Constants.swift",
      "table": "Common",
      "package": "l10n-00-infra"
    },
